WEBVTT

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.760
My Mom and my sisters moved 
overseas because of Dad's job...

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.300
...so now I'm living alone 
starting this spring.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:28.770
However, my first time living 
alone only lasted for a few days.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.580
Hey, Rikka. I'm opening the door.

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:38.010
Wake up already. School starts today.

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:41.400
In a virtual repeat of 
last year's attempt...

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.330
...to keep my dark chunibyo 
history safely hidden away...

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:46.520
...and start life anew in high school...

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.250
...Rikka Takanashi here foiled me again.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.080
I command you to awaken, 
Rikka Takanashi!

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:55.280
Or rather, Wicked Lord Shingan. 
The time of awakening has come!

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:33.340
Rikka, is sunny side up okay?

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:35.050
Dark side up, please.

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:36.840
"Sunny side up" it is.

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.840
Turn over!

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:40.240
So, which is it?

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:42.560
I gave her too many options.

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:44.240
Yuta!

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:44.850
Yes?

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:47.060
I can't find the ribbon 
for my school uniform.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:48.450
Huh?

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.230
Gasp! Was it their doing?!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.660
I let my guard down.

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:55.820
That's why I told you to 
get it ready yesterday.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:57.230
I'm coming in.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.210
There's no time for goofing around!

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.760
I'll yank out your antenna hair!

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:08.370
Please don't! It's my 
most attractive feature!

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:13.540
Rikka's mother also had to move out 
of town for work this spring...

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:18.050
...which led to Rikka having to 
live on her own as well, however...

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.580
Heave-ho...

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:21.680
Why are your things being moved out?

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:24.180
Have they finally made their move?!

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:27.680
What? Rikka's grandfather accidentally 
let go of their apartment?

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.430
It's sabotage!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.200
I guess you'll have to live with me 
until your new place is sorted out.

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.810
Activating emergency code: Triple Four!

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:40.650
And so, Rikka temporarily 
came to live with me.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:44.430
It's pleasant to be woken up by you.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:46.390
WICKED LORD SHINGAN... REBORN

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.300
Put yourself in my shoes.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.120
That would never fly with the priestess.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:52.760
I lied to Toka and told her I'd 
placed Rikka in a small apartment

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:56.010
and we are one week into 
our deceitful life.

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:59.920
Chimera, I give you my demonic fruit.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.890
I am positive you are 
immune to red fruits.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.550
This proves nothing!

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:12.870
Try one. They taste as 
good as strawberries.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.310
That is impossible!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:19.010
You're becoming more and 
more like the priestess.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.040
Are you under her influence?!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.650
I'm saying it for your own good.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:27.740
Yuta!

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:31.180
The fluid! The green, squishy 
matter is attacking me!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.290
Wait! Stay perfectly still.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:35.420
Wiping at it will only make it worse.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:38.270
You need to dab at it like this...

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:44.230
<i>If you're heading out, please do take 
a collapsible umbrella with you.</i>

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:47.550
You could say we're a couple.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.560
We're a couple, but...

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.480
How do you get to romance from 
this kind of a starting point?

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.450
I've never even had a normal 
girlfriend before...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.210
...so having a first girlfriend with 
chunibyo sets the bar even higher.

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:05.280
Things settled down in a way that 
isn't much different from before.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:09.590
Guten morgen!

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:13.250
My name is Shinka Nibutani, and I'm in 
Year Two in high school starting today!

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:14.840
Nibutani?

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.000
Nibutani!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.250
How do you do, everyone?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.930
Let's make it another good year.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:21.910
Sure.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:24.020
What's wrong with her?

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:24.880
High school Year Two debut?

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.090
I'm going to say this one more time.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.930
Remember what you promised yesterday.

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:32.150
Of course.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:35.420
Based on the hieroglyphs, the 
hateful magic barrier attack

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:36.990
triggered by the Freemasons...

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:37.970
Wrong!

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.580
Our uninvited guests from
 the unfathomable parallel world?

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.680
Not that either.

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:45.360
Do you mean our discussion about 
performing the Schrodinger's

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.010
cat experiment using Chimera?

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.200
Never! Don't do it!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.050
You know. How we're living 
together at my place.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.720
Oh, yes. That.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.700
That is the only thing 
I spoke to you about.

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.640
We should drop by the 
realty office again today.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:02.180
If you are referring to my new 
base, it has already been located.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:02.930
For real?

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.690
It is the demon world of 
the impossibly Wicked One,

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:06.880
invisible to mere mortals!

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:09.250
I thought you were being serious!

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.490
I'll yank out your antenna hair!

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:11.890
No, don't!

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.260
I see you lovebirds are already at it.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:15.450
Who are you?

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.910
It's me, Isshiki. Makoto Isshiki!

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.030
Friend of yours?

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:19.650
Nope.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.650
It's me! The guy in 
the Light Music Club!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.980
The guy who sacrificed everything
 for Upperclassman Kumin!

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.830
Oh, it's the crew cut guy.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.250
Mister Crew Cut!

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:31.410
Stop calling me that! That 
version of me is dead!

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.720
Just look at my Rock'n'Roll hair!

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.510
Isshiki, what happened to your head?

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:38.160
Huh?

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:40.560
Let's go visit the student councilor.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:42.100
You're getting it all wrong, Sensei.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:45.230
My hair type changed when it grew back.

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:45.800
Whatever you say.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.670
Hey, Upperclassman Kumin!
 Good morning!

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:50.570
I wonder who that was?

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:51.390
Kumin.

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:54.470
Rikka and Togashi. Morning.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.200
You're both new Second Years today.

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:00.230
And now you're a Third Year.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.990
Uh-huh. And it's such a let-down.

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.870
Cause you'll have to study for
 university entrance exams.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:08.540
Uh-uh, that isn't what I 
mean. I'm disappointed.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:09.740
Want to know why?

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:10.610
Why?

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:13.350
Because Year Three is sooo next year.

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.780
That's funny.

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:20.010
That's how it told me to deliver it.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:21.790
Um, what have you got there?

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:25.890
You know how Mori Summer
 always makes everybody laugh?

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:28.420
I want to be just like her.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:31.010
Growing older brings many changes.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.990
Mori Summer!

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:38.600
Morning! What are you supposed to be?

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:42.660
How do you do, Upperclassman Kumin?

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.900
I am wearing regulation attire.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.420
"How do you do?"

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:48.450
Is that an advanced level joke?

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:50.750
Senpai, if I might have a word...

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.380
Mori Summer, where are we going?

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:56.990
DEKOMORI                                                                                    DEKOMORI

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:56.990
Death.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:08:02.500
And so, let's all share 
another lively school year.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:04.630
Thank you for that speech.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.640
I'll show you.

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.490
I made a lot of mistakes...

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:08.000
...but that's all going 
to change this year.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:12.940
I swear I will claw my way 
to the top of this school!

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:11.560
The next speech comes
 from our new students...

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:13.960
...represented by Sanae Dekomori.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:14.590
Wha-?!

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:20.980
I am the new student 
representative, Sanae Dekomori.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:23.980
With the warm days of Spring...

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:26.870
...the trees become enrobed 
in fresh, new green livery.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:29.220
They say that she got better grades 
than you had last year, Nibutani.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:30.230
Our student lives also begin anew.

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.230
Oh, really?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.400
That's amazing.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:32.950
Deko!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.170
Hey, what happened?

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:42.370
Ahem.

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:45.600
I believe everyone knows 
that in this world...

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.290
...there are white 
worlds and dark worlds.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:48.790
Wha-?

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:52.940
"Seeing spirits requires 
the proper heart."

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:55.140
"Love is everything."

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.320
Hey, are you feeling all right?

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:03.280
Sensei, Nibutani has fainted!

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:04.940
What are they doing?

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.440
We share the same class 
once again, Light Being.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.730
What ever are you saying, Takanashi?

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:11.790
Are you okay?

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.060
Takanashi!

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.590
We're in the same class.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.040
Let's have another good year.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:18.530
Let's.

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.700
Miss Nanase is our home room teacher.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:22.370
Togashi.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:25.160
They told to get my hair 
cut for school tomorrow.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.030
What'll I do?

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:28.470
How should I know? It's 
your own damned fault.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:30.730
Wait, are we in the same class again?

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.250
No, I'm in Class 3 next door.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:33.480
That so?

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:34.460
Is that relief?!

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:37.650
You made no attempt to hide your relief!

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.390
Togashi, a moment.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.850
Who is this beautiful girl?

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:42.400
Pleased to meet you.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.730
Are you Togashi's friend? My name is...

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:45.730
Pot, meet kettle.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.100
I'm only bringing this up 
because we share a classroom.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:52.580
I have given Takanashi clear instructions...

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:55.460
…not to share information about
 my time in middle school with anyone.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:56.990
Are you still on that?

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:59.960
I pondered all through spring break.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:03.250
I pondered my decision to attend 
this particular high school.

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.500
Do I really intend to spend three 
years of my life in that loser's club?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.600
Hey, are you okay?

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.430
Servant to Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:13.710
User of the Mjolnir 
Hammer, Sanae Dekomori...

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.460
...is hereby reborn!

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:21.030
Only the deviously
 devious Fake Mori Summer...

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:23.320
would dare stage an attack 
on me in my temporary guise.

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.020
You are rotten to the core.

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.020
Now observe!

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.830
I spin right left, and left right.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:33.540
The opposing revolutions shall produce 
a kink between dimensions and space!

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:38.700
And by adding an additional revolution, 
I shall produce unlimited power!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.160
Take this! The Mjolnir...

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.910
You sure have weak semicircular canals.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:46.630
Dekomori will not be defeated!

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.200
Rich Cheese (6 pcs)

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:50.200
Because you're such an 
energetic First Year...

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.020
...as a reward, I will 
give you the cheese

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.370
love. So. Much.

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:57.230
Don't you think you're overdoing it?

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:59.760
One must deal with trouble 
of one's creation.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.720
Paging a student.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:06.700
Rikka Takanashi from Year 2, Class 4.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.780
Please report to the staff 
room immediately. I repeat.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.900
Rikka Takanashi from Year 2, Class 4,

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.900
please report to the 
staff room immediately.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.330
The school has been 
overrun by terrorists!

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:18.630
Hardly.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:28.470
Letters?

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:32.080
That's the thing. The school mailed 
at least three to your home.

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.390
They all came back returned to sender.

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.210
That may be due to the fact that my

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.760
existence had been 
erased from this world.

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:41.630
When we phone you, it says 
that number is not in use.

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:43.390
My existence had been erased.

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:47.810
But you exist right now, so 
perhaps it'll go through now.

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:48.680
You won't.

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:49.520
Why not?

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:51.740
My eye! My eye!

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.060
That's way too weak!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.060
Far-East Magical Napping Society - Summer Thereof

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:58.570
She seemed to buy it, but we 
can't keep this up forever.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.710
Don't say that.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.220
But it's hard.

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.950
Can't you just try to take a bite?

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:13.670
Come over here and join us, Rikka.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.160
No, thank you.

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:17.930
The incubus lives in that coffin.

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:21.800
Even one forged in the darkness 
such as I dare not approach.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.680
I once experienced a frightening 
dream while under its influence.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:28.060
Really? What did you dream about?

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:36.700
Ugh, the light! The Light 
Being is paralyzing me!

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:38.290
What're you doing?

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.000
Ow?

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:41.170
Why is "ow" in the form of a question?

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:42.400
No particular reason.

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:45.070
If you had to choose, where 
would you want to live?

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.420
Live?

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:48.130
What we were talking about before.

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:51.160
Regarding your new base 
and battle formation.

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:53.180
The base where my Wicked Lord

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:55.330
Shingan and the Dark 
Flame Master manifest...

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:58.040
...is also an excellent 
geomagnetic focal point.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:00.460
You know it that's out.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.010
I know.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:05.550
Nibutani.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.940
Hey, what's with the costume?

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:09.360
Is that idiot here?

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:12.430
Look at what she did to
 my costume for Theatre Club!

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:12.430
FAKE

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.240
She's sleeping inside.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:15.060
Sleeping?

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.360
How convenient.

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:18.690
PERMANENT MARKER

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:19.540
Later!

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:20.160
Later.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:21.620
What, you're leaving?

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:23.170
Something like that.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:25.420
We must search for a new base.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.280
Zip it. C'mon.

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:28.570
Base?

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.580
For all that...

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:34.460
I have no idea where you 
should set up house alone.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:37.910
I favor a subterranean labyrinth, 
but a medieval castle will do.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:39.770
Get real.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:43.140
Past the corner store is a
 castle with a sign saying "Aegean Sea."

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:47.880
You idiot! You can't stay there!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.350
Yuta.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:52.930
I’m sorry. I didn’t think the
 rent would be that expensive...

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.850
I mean, I knew it might be expensive.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.810
Actually, I don't know 
much about it either.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:02.900
I mean… It has to be expensive.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:10.530
Yuta.

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:15.620
Will I be barred from this place once 
I have transferred to my new base?

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:17.600
Don't be silly.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:21.210
But I won't come here when I 
commute to and from school.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:23.880
Well, yeah, probably not.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:28.230
I won't be able to go to your room to 
report activity in the magical realm.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:30.180
What a shame.

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:31.680
But...

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:37.180
I'll drop by to pick you up for school.

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:40.840
We need to find you a place 
nearby so I can visit.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.690
Don't you want to stay together?

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.570
You two!

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:52.030
Nibutani.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:56.090
Takanashi's apartment is 
vacant. What's going on?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.850
Did you move, Rikka?

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:00.350
Well, actually...

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.040
Let's have an explanation.

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:05.050
Toka?!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.730
I leave for Italy soon...

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:10.710
...but you won't give me your new 
address or answer your phone.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:11.800
What's the story?

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.360
Uh, it's not what you think!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.360
Yuta! Run for it!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:18.320
You dummy!

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:22.480
I see. You are attempting 
to maintain secrecy.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.070
Master!

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:26.540
Schwing!

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:27.400
Dekomori!

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:30.920
I was right to tail Fake Summer!

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:34.550
I, your loyal servant, will 
buy you the time you need!

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:36.990
Masters, please evacuate to safety!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:39.890
Do you realize who you're up against?

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.120
Natch!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:43.930
She is the priestess who, 
in a previous batle...

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:46.560
...once force-fed me a 
mass of rotten dairy!

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:49.260
I couldn't wish for a worthier opponent.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:51.510
Now, come at me!

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:59.450
Hey, you! Your hand! Your hand!

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.060
DUMMY

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:05.410
I know your intent now.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:08.790
No! You're wrong! This 
isn't what it looks like!

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.500
This is Fake Mori Summer's doing!

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.040
Hey! It's your fault to begin with.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:16.000
I deeply respect you, Priestess!

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:19.790
As my master's sister, 
I am at your command!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.370
Stop trying to throw me under the bus!

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.790
You two are such good friends.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.020
I'm sorry. My hand slipped.

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:30.010
What?!

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:31.550
All hands, prepare for combat!

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:33.990
Assume positions and 
prepare to intercept!

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:36.100
Be destroyed, real.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.610
Blow up, synapses!

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:40.180
Vanishment This World!

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:09.960
Dark Matter Blaze.

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.440
It's no good.

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:18.860
She easily deflected 
your Dark Matter Blaze.

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:20.890
She's unbelievable.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.430
It's all or nothing!

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:25.780
L!

00:17:25.780 --> 00:17:26.450
L! O!

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:26.950
L! O! V!

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:27.620
L! O! V! E!

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:29.620
Love!

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.790
How about a physical attack?

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:36.910
Direct Impact!

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:44.200
Machine Gun!

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.200
(DEMON GOD GUN) MA SHIN GAN

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:45.180
Machine Gun!

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.110
Yuta!

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:54.850
Schwarz Shield!

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:56.760
Arrostire!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:59.180
What's arrostire?

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.160
It means "oven roasted."

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:03.950
Yuta!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:05.390
Too hot!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:14.880
You shacked up?!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.070
Really?

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:18.570
Like I said, it's not what you think.

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:20.440
In what way?

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:23.990
You're living together as 
boyfriend and girlfriend.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.460
Please control your 
disgusting imagination.

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.600
What do you mean, disgusting?

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:31.890
I think you're the one 
with the dirty mind.

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:36.470
W-what? I, Dekomori, am 
always pure of thought!

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:39.200
You've gone beet red.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.100
For a little kid, you 
have a really dirty mind.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:44.200
Be quiet! Be quiet, 
you big-boobed freak!

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.350
Hey, stop that!

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:48.230
Shacking is sooo shocking!

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:50.620
That hurt.

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:55.170
Anyway, it's really 
not what you think...

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.610
...and we had no choice.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.300
You're saying that a full grown 
boy like yourself had no choice...

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:01.380
....but to shack up with 
my little sister with whom

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:03.110
you are in a romantic relationship?

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.040
That's not what I meant.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.970
You are not in a romantic relationship?

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:07.960
Uh, no...

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:09.430
You guys split up?

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:10.970
You dissolved your pact?

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:12.270
Who dumped whom?

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:14.800
Quit it! I'm saying we 
are not "shacking up!"

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:16.210
How is that different?

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.230
Yes, we are living together...

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:21.190
...but it's mostly because I was

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:23.120
concerned about leaving 
Rikka on her own.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:26.810
It's been almost a week now, and 
nothing of the sort is going on.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:27.990
Of what sort?

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:28.930
Beat it, all of you!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:30.690
How about it?

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:33.250
Our contract remains unaltered.

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:36.000
In other words, we're 
not "living together"...

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.460
...that's it! We're roommates!

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.390
It's a home share situation. You know!

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:41.030
Ow!

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:43.460
Do you think that logic will fly by me?

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:45.590
Do you think I will permit that?

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:47.660
You are a boy!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.680
My magazine!

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.830
No matter what, you 
cannot live together.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:53.560
I will find her an apartment. If 
you have a problem with that...

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:55.380
...I will take Rikka to Italy with me.

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:56.710
Italy?

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:59.700
The magical society! The Cardinal!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.970
Am I to be imprisoned in such a place?

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:06.210
Italy is home to the occult!

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:08.390
The Vatican, Sixth Sense, 
I see dead people!

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:10.240
Home to the occult?

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.170
So, you want to go now?

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:13.310
Yes?

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:15.320
I'm home.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:17.200
Good evening.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:19.530
Kuzuha, why are you here?

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:21.670
I came home.

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:24.820
Surely you were told I was coming 
back for the new school term.

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:27.080
I was told? By who?

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:28.460
By Mom.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:32.870
Oops, I forgot!

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.380
Rikka has been living here?

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.130
What's so bad about that?

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:37.980
Huh?

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.200
After all, she doesn't have 
her own place, right?

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.040
We have plenty of rooms here.

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:44.390
You're really sure?

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:51.820
To be honest, I was also concerned 
about leaving Rikka on her own.

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:55.270
If you would act as supervisor, 
it should be okay.

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:59.780
I'm sorry. Please let her stay 
here just a little longer.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:01.780
Sure.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.960
Understood. You can count on me.

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:07.530
Hurry up and find your own place.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:12.960
And so, my life alone with 
Rikka came to an abrupt end...

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.460
TOGASHI
 MAIL FOR TAKANASHI HERE

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:16.360
...and three teenagers began
 life together that spring.

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:23.590
Yuta's notebook. I forgot 
to return it to him.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:35.350
Rikka?

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.230
Not again.

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:44.970
What the-?

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.290
Did someone new move in?

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:52.160
She never was able to 
get her apartment back.

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:05.970
To Be Continued
